Package: slurmworkflow
Title: Build workflows for the Slurm workload manager
Version: 0.2.0
Date: 2023-04-05
Authors@R:
    c(person(given = "Adrien",
             family = "Le Guillou",
             role = c("aut", "cre"),
             email = "contact@aleguillou.org",
             comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-4791-418X")))
Description: Build multi-step workflows on Slurm-equipped high-performance
    computing clusters. Named steps can run sequentially, branch, or loop through
    static successors and one-shot runtime messages. A bash-only controller
    submits resolved jobs, while R helpers provide templates, array mapping,
    dynamic map sizes, and thin wrappers around the workflow command.
